msgstr "在游戏内显示给该玩家。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1423
msgid "Kick — disconnected now; they may rejoin immediately"
msgstr "踢出 — 立即断开连接；他们可以马上重新加入"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1424
#, python-brace-format
